    "body": "OK. I don't think we should assume it would be incompatible, given that only one browser fires such input events and didn't encounter any compatibility issues going from 0 -> 1.\r\n\r\nI think conceptually it is a good idea to use input to signal changes to the control, like it is used for all other controls.",
