    "created_at": "2017-03-27T19:49:42Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-03-27T19:49:42Z",
    "body": "One thing we need to discuss is: under this proposal, would all radios in the group receive an input event? If it's only the checked and unchecked radios, that is still not sufficient for monitoring value changes without being aware of the other radios in the group. E.g. if I have 4 radio buttons, A, B, C, D and I uncheck A by selecting D, the entire group's selected value has changed, but no event has fired on B and C.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
